SUMMARY:Festival of Fabulous Mums: The 13 Classes of Rare & Heirloom Chrysanthemums with Margie Case
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a series of free demonstrations and workshops during the Festival of Fabulous Mums at Duke Gardens! In this session\, Margie Case will describe and explain the 13 classes of chrysanthemums. Learn how and why show mums are classified and categorized before or after you view them at the Festival of Fabulous Mums. \nThis series of free demonstrations and workshops will take place in the Pelham-Cullen Classroom inside the Barnes Welcome Center. No registration required. Seating is limited and available on a first-come\, first-served basis. Doors open 15 min before the scheduled start time. \n  \n 
URL:https://gardens.duke.edu/event/festival-of-fabulous-mums-the-13-classes-of-rare-heirloom-chrysanthemums-with-margie-case/
