SUMMARY:Triangle Orchid Society Fall for Orchids Show
DESCRIPTION:Marvel at hundreds of blooming orchids in lush garden-like displays for your enjoyment. Attend free talks and demonstrations about growing orchids at home by expert speakers. Orchids will be available for sale. This free drop-in festival is presented in partnership with the Triangle Orchid Society; for more information\, visit www.triangleorchidsociety.org. \nOrchid Festival Dates:\nFriday\, November 20\, 1-5 p.m.\nSaturday\, November 21\, 10 a.m.-5 p.m.\nSunday\, November 22\, 10 a.m.-3 p.m. \nFee: Free drop-in festival for all ages; no registration required. Children must be accompanied by an adult. \nParking: Parking fees apply. \nLocation: Doris Duke  Center \nAccessibility: This festival takes place indoors in a location accessible by paved surfaces. Accessible restrooms are available onsite.
